  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian assistance to Ukraine for financial year 2023-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will provide humanitarian aid in response to the conflict in Ukraine. Funding will support the provision of food, water, shelter, health and protection services. It will be delivered through the Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs in coordination with humanitarian partners including NGOs. The investment will support vulnerable and affected groups, including women, children and people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
